Package: lofiterm
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Mohamed Bouhlel <63722008+mohamedbouhlel@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6, libcurl4t64, libgcc-s1, libncursesw6, libstdc++6, libtinfo6
Description: local LLM agent with a ncurses terminal interface
 LOFITERM is a local C++ agent with a classic terminal interface and a
 ncursesw full-screen interface. It requires Linux Landlock support.
